window.products.push({"id":309052,"name":"Rechargeable Portable Air Conditioner, CEROBEAR Mini Evaporative Air Cooler with 3 Speeds 120° Oscillating, 3 in 1 Aromatherapy Misting Fan for Desk/B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sCxZBRuKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3-in-1 Functional Mini Air Conditioner】Do you think it's just a room cooler air conditioner? No, it's a combination of a mini air conditioner, aroma diffuser and night light. There is a built-in aromatherapy tablet, you can drop essential oils on the tablet, let the scent fill your room and sleep more comfortably. Soft night light make your room more beautiful and romantic, creating an ideal sleeping environment for you and your family. 【Cordless Portable Air Conditioner for Outdoor/Indoor Use】It is a cordless tent air conditioner. 1.98lb/7*5.8*10.8 inches, the compact and handheld design makes it easy to carry. You can put this mini ac unit on your bedroom/kitchen/dorms/office, or take it on a picnic/fishing trip/camping, it can also be used in a car/RVs, provides you a chilly wave of coolness like a forest breeze anytime and anywhere. 【4000mAh Rechargeable & 120°Oscillating Cooling Mister Fan】The rechargeable portable air conditioner has a built-in 4000mAh battery, a full charge (2 hour) can be used for 5 hours at the highest wind speed. Can be powered by adapters,mobile power supplies,computers,car chargers. 120° Oscillating, simulating the frequency of natural wind, to avoid long-term headaches or colds while sleeping. 3 speeds can meet all the needs for coolness. 【More Efficient & Cost-saving】Compared to traditional air conditioners, our battery powered air conditioner can reduce electricity usage by up to 70% to ease your bills. We use ultrasonic technology to atomize water into nano-cool mist to relieve itchy eyes, throat and skin in dry climates. You can add ice cubes or ice water into the tank for an extra cooling effec. 350mL large capacity water tank can can last 3 hours of mist cooling function. 【Quality Assurance & 100% Satisfaction】What you get?-- rechargeable mini air conditioner*1, type-c cable*1, Aromatherapy tablet*1, user manual*1. Our water fan has passed CE and FCC RoHS certifications and passed 10000 tests to ensure its safety, please use it with confidence. During the 12-month period, if there is any product problem under normal use, we will provide the best solution for you. Zero-risk purchase, \"Add to Cart\" now！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sCxZBRuKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CEROBEAR","source_asin":"B09YD3YS39","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-309052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YD3YS39","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YD3YS39","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
