window.products.push({"id":309089,"name":"Livordo Turkish Towel Beach Soft Absorbent 100% Cotton Made in Turkey Quick Dry Bath, Sauna, Hamam, Spa, Yoga, Gym, Throw Large Blanket Peshtemal, Pes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ET1dESkhL._AC_.jpg","description":"Authentic Turkish towels , sometimes called Peshtemal , Pestemal , Hammam or Fouta towels are handmade from 100% pure Turkish cotton . Originating in Turkish bath houses, these lightweight towels became famous for being ultra-absorbent and luxuriously soft . Charming stripes and fringed edges give these towels a sophisticated look with a vintage appeal. Bulky towels are also annoyingly slow to dry, staying wet long after use and often developing an unpleasant musty scent. Handwoven Turkish towels are almost shockingly thin for the level of absorbency they provide and very quick drying . This world-famous, wonderfully soft handwoven fabric is known to get even softer and fluffier with each wash cycle . Livordo towels are truly one of a kind. Gentle enough for the baby sensitive skin, they are perfect for spa days, lounging under the hot sun, or just drying off after a shower, hot bath, or a fun day at the lake. Standard terry cloth towels are often big and heavy, taking up a lot of space in your linen closet and don’t travel well due to their excess weight and bulk. A Livordo towel folds up neatly into an ultra-compact pillow , taking up so much less space that it’s easy to take along wherever you go! Significantly lighter , thinner , and more compact than bulky terry cloth bath and beach towels, they make excellent bath towels, but also work great as picnic blankets, tablecloths, decorative hangings, throws, shawls, wraps, sarongs, pareos, and even scarves. These lovely towels are perfect for the beach, picnics, outdoor gatherings, sport events, camping, pools, spa, gyms, and so much more. Try a Turkish towel today Key Features 100% Premium Turkish Cotton | All-Natural Vegetable Dyes |  Incredibly Absorbent | Ultra-Thin, Folds into a Compact Pillow | Oversized 37 x 70 inches | Satisfaction Guaranteed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ET1dESkhL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Livordo","source_asin":"B079BPP81Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-309089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079BPP81Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079BPP81Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
