window.products.push({"id":309114,"name":"Stainless Steel Stemless Wine Tumbler – 12 Oz., Double-Insulated Travel Wine Glass or Coffee Mug with Lid Keeps Beverages Hot and Cold for Hours – Win","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yvPhjsXVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sealed, Secured, and SUBLIMEDIf there’s one sound that can stop a party, it’s the sound of a breaking glass. When wine glasses are a potential hazard, trust your sturdy wine tumbler with lid that can handle a fall. Feel at ease bringing along your best chardonnay or merlot to your next outdoor outing thanks to a spill-proof lid that ensures you can relish every last drop. It’s always wine o’clock with your insulated tumbler cup from SUBLIMED!You’re Hot and ColdNothing is worse than chilly coffee, except maybe a toasty riesling! Safeguard your favorite drinks with your temperature-controlled stainless steel cups constructed with a vacuum-sealed, double wall. Keep your hot liquids warm for 1 to 3 hours and icy drinks cold for 6 to 9 hours! Enjoy your insulated coffee mug on your morning commute, and then fill with your best-loved iced tea in the evening.Features to SavorRevel in the benefits of your insulated tumbler:– Why have less scato when you can have mo’ scato? Small glasses of wine tend to need refilling often; your 12 oz. tumbler means you can fill the fun higher.– From cocktails to coffee, experience long-lasting flavor with your food-grade, 18/8 stainless steel wine tumbler that's dishwasher-safe and resists rust and corrosion. – No drips or slips allowed. Your ergonomic, insulated mug fits snugly in your hand and protects your fingertips from the heat of hot drinks.Gift With Great TasteSend a gift that’s convenient and versatile to the special person in your life. Your tumbler with lid can begin the day as your handy travel coffee mug, then transform into a stemless wine glass. Match your drink with your style thanks to 8 sleek colors!Take life one sip at a time with your insulated wine tumblers from SUBLIMED!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yvPhjsXVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUBLIMED","source_asin":"B096FVS5TX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-309114","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096FVS5TX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096FVS5TX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
