window.products.push({"id":309153,"name":"Zojirushi ADC-05 Electric Dispensing Pot Cleaner 1 Oz.(28 gr.)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iQD4NEFVL._AC_.jpg","description":"This safe and economical cleaner from Zojirushi removes lime, scale and mineral deposit build-up from electric dispensing pots, air pots and carafes. A clean pot means proper water temperature and a fresh clean taste for beverages! This cleaner will extend the life of your appliance by keeping it clean internally! Not for use on aluminum. This item is safe to pour down the sink and will not harm plumbing or septic systems, is non-toxic and biodegradable. Sold in single packs of 1 ounce. For optimal results we recommend using 1 pack for each liter of capacity of the item being cleaned (example: a 4 -Liter capacity pot will need 4 packets of cleaner). You should clean the pot or appliance once a year if using bottled or filtered water or every 6 months for tap water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iQD4NEFVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zojirushi","source_asin":"B000GFJ9W4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-309153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000GFJ9W4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000GFJ9W4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":309154,"name":"Stackable Storage Baskets for Shelves - Large Foldable Storage Bins Box with Cotton Rope Handles and Label Holders Collapsible Sturdy Fabric Storage C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M2NBOyGqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COLLAPSIBLE SPACE SAVING DESIGN: Side design makes these Baskets collapsible which will take full advantage of your closet shelves, under coffee tables, and in dorm rooms. Also It can fold when not in use. PREMIUM MATERIAL: The outer layer is woven from natural linen, and the middle and bottom are supported by high-density boards to strengthen the structure, it can bear 25lbs heavy load. LARGE SIZE: Storage container dimension to 13”x 13”x 13”(33 x 33 x 33cm),it's a multi-purpose bin, utilize as clothes baskets,closet organization bins, toy storage box,blankets books office documents... STURDY HANDLES and LABEL CARDS: Both sides of the storage box are equipped with cotton rope handles, which are soft and can be moved easily.The front is equipped with a transparent label card holder , which can allows for easy content labeling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M2NBOyGqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CYhom","source_asin":"B091KWNQPX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-309154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091KWNQPX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091KWNQPX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":309155,"name":"Waterford Fine China Padova 5-Piece Place Setting, Service for 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416KPQ5KJTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Inspired by the architecture and artwork of the historical Padua commune in Northern Italy, Waterford Padova china is exquisite fine china characterized by timeless elegance. This 5-Piece Place Setting includes everything needed for one guest's full dinner service: dinner plate, salad plate, bread & butter plate, cup & saucer - all decorated with a delicate cream and pearl white motif accented with raised beading and trimmed in platinum; bringing elegant simplicity to any dining table. Amazon.com Padova dinnerware evokes elegance at special occasion dinners or brunches without being stuffy. Clean and understated, the fine bone china is trimmed with shining platinum bands that encase a diamond motif of fine cream-colored lines. Raised white enamel beads on the diamond border feel luscious under the fingertips. Included in this place setting for one are a dinner plate, salad plate, rimmed soup plate, teacup, and saucer, all in the same design. Accent pieces and accessories decorated with silvery floral patterning are available separately. While all Waterford platinum-trimmed china is dishwasher-safe at low temperatures, washing by hand will help preserve the platinum's rich luster. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box Dinner Plate, Salad Plate, Bread & Butter Plate, Teacup, Tea Saucer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416KPQ5KJTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterford","source_asin":"B0001U5S4W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-309155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001U5S4W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001U5S4W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":309156,"name":"Classic Brands Cambridge Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support, Full, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918fLOpdcWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Instantly update the look of your bedroom by adding this DeCoro Cambridge Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support . Classic styling with sturdy and durable wooden slat and center support system can be used for any mattress type or size; no box-spring needed. The Cambridge is constructed from metal tubing that is not only strong but both lightweight and long-lasting. Perfect for contemporary and modern bedrooms, the Cambridge headboard comes upholstered with a button-tufted fabric that is soft to the touch. The low-profile bed frame is supported by 8-inch legs and the headboard reaches a height of 3 3/4-feet. Available in both grey and linen. Combine our DeCoro Cambridge Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support with your memory foam, latex, or innerspring mattress to add unparalleled support. It will extend the longevity of your mattress by properly supporting your mattress, so it doesn’t sag. The slats are specifically designed to be spaced evenly across the top of the platform to form a solid base for your mattress, insuring even weight distribution and to prevent the mattress from sagging. The sturdy center support system is a must have for today’s heavier mattresses and is not typically found in other platform beds and is what really differentiates our bed frame from others. Benefits of the DeCoro Cambridge Upholstered Platform Bed DeCoro Cambridge Upholstered Platform Bed is a decorative way to give your mattress some extra support. The headboard, foundation, and frame are an all in one solution and is an excellent choice as a fashionable alternative to a traditional box spring and frame. You’ll love the way this headboard enhances the look of your bedroom. Features of the DeCoro Cambridge Upholstered Platform Bed With classic styling, the DeCoro Cambridge Upholstered Platform Bed is perfect for contemporary and modern bedrooms. Not only is the platform bed well-built and durable, it’s beautiful and soft button-tufted rectangular headboard reaches a height of 3 ¾ feet which instantly updates the look of your bedroom. The upholstered fabric is soft to the touch and the platform bed is available in either grey or linen and is now available in full, queen, or king sizes. Easy Assembly The DeCoro Upholstered Headboard Platform Bed is easy to assemble; it can be put together in less than an hour. All parts, tools, and instructions are neatly packed in a zippered compartment in the back of the headboard. Just unpack, assemble the frame and attach the hardware and you are ready to place your mattress (and foundation if you please) on top. It is recommended that the upholstered bed frame should be assembled in the room that it is intended for use: •Step 1- Take all components out of the box and position them on the floor •Step 2- Attach the legs to the bottom of the headboard and to the bottom of the footboard •Step 3- Assemble the left side rails to the center horizontal support rail. Assemble the right-side rails to the center horizontal support rail.  •Step 4- Attach the headboard to the assembled side rails •Step 5- Attach the footboard to the assembled side rails •Step 6- Attach the center support rails to the middle of assembled bed •Step 7- Attach the horizontal center support rail to the middle of the assembled bed •Step 8- Attach the wood slats •Step 7- Place your mattress on top and enjoy! Get it Right the First Time It is also a good idea to check the size and the height of your mattress to make sure you are ordering the correct size. Keep in mind that you should combine the height of the frame, foundation (if you are adding one), and the mattress to get a gauge of the how tall your bed will be. Also note, because of the solid construction of this platform bed, it is recommended that two people lift and assemble the bed. Total weight should not exceed 700 lbs. including the mattress. • Full Size - 59\" W x 84\" L x 47\" H x 78 lbs • Queen Size - 65\" W x 88\" L x 47\" H x 82 lbs • King Size - 81\" W x 88\" L x 47\" H x 99 lbs Quality Assurance DeCoro Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support is backed with a 3-year worry-free warranty. DeCoro carries a wide variety of upholstered platform bed frames in an assortment of designs to match your unique taste and style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918fLOpdcWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Brands","source_asin":"B077SQ15LZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-309156","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077SQ15LZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077SQ15LZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":309157,"name":"Sisiru Stand Mixer, 660W 6+P Speed Tilt-Head Electric Kitchen Mixer with 8.5 Qt Stainless Steel Bowl Dough Hooks, Whisk, Beater and Suction Cup Bottom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cYEEgzzuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High Power And Fast Efficiency - Our electric mixers as US standards stronger power and rated Voltage(660W, 120V), combined with the 3D all direction planetary mixing action to perfectly beat and knead ingredients faster and more efficiently than another traditional, saving you time and effort! 6+P Speed Control - 6 Adjustable Speeds range of low and high speeds handles a variety of recipes and baking needs, ranging from egg whites to bread dough,and additional pulse sett for quick blitzing egg whites. Easy To Clean, Dishwasher Safe - This Sisiru Electric Stand Mixer practices a combination of classical and popular. The best ornament in your kitchen you shouldn't miss. All of the attachments are dishwasher-safe for quick and easy cleaning. Just throw them in the dishwasher, and you're all set. Large Capacity To Meet The Needs Of A Family - 8.5qt bigger stainless steel single-handle bowl provides enough capacity which is big enough to make about 2kg flour for your special occasion like Christmas, thanksgiving day, or family days. The stronger vacuum pressure suction cup of the bottom of stand mixer, easy to use no need to worry about our small kitchen stuff moving on the table. Extremely low machine noise to ensure smooth operation of the machine(low noise ≤75dB) After-Sales Service Is Worry-Free - SUPPORT 24/7 ONLINE SERVICE, please contact us if you have any questions during use. Sisiru brand is designed for people who love baking more effectively, replace of traditional manual labor. Hereby, we will offer a full 5-year quality guarantee and lifetime technical support for our valued customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cYEEgzzuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sisiru","source_asin":"B09D7JC9PY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-309157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D7JC9PY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D7JC9PY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
