window.products.push({"id":309174,"name":"FRMARCH Heavy Duty Mesh Laundry Bag- Set of 5 Wash Bag for Intimates Garment Bra and Lingerie-Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DR7aVmN0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Polyester & Polyester Blend PERFECT WASHING BAG SET: This premium mesh laundry bags is what you need to have in your house!! Set of 5 including Quality Mesh Wash Bag for Blouse, Hosiery, Stocking, Underwear, Bra and Lingerie, Intimates Lingerie and Delicates.Our mesh laundry wash bags will help keep your laundry looking and feeling newer, longer. COMBINATION OF BAG SIZES FOR MUTIPURPOSE: Mesh Laundry Bag: Set of 5 wash bags composed of 1 x Extra Large:19.7“*23.6\", 1 x Large: 15.7\"*19.7\", 2 x Cylindrical laundry Bags: 11\"*13.8\" and 5.9\"*7.1\", 1 x lingerie underwear Bags: 13\"*9.8\". The clear multipurpose bags securely clip your bags to other items SUPERIOR MATERIALS & DURABLE CONSTRUCTION: Made from breathable fibers, durable polyester mesh fabric, allowing the water and soap to freely flow inside the bags for a thorough washing while keeping your treasured clothes remain stunning like new. Polyester is strong and not easy to be worn or torn; air dry fast and do not retain any musty odor after being wet. ANTI-STUCK ZIPPER AND ANTI-OPENING ELASTIC STRAP: Strategically-positioned inside runners will prevent our HEAVY-DUTY plastic zippers from getting jammed. The Original delicate laundry washing bag includes an elastic strap for the zipper to ensure that the bag will not open in the washer. TRAVEL ORGANIZER BAG: See through mesh makes it easy for you to find your belongings and keep them from getting lost. This also makes security checks at the airport quick and convenient. These clear multipurpose bags securely clip your bags to other items. Store each pouch in your luggage, purse, duffel, backpack, beach bag, baby diaper bags","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DR7aVmN0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRMARCH","source_asin":"B0711C84ZR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-309174","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0711C84ZR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0711C84ZR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
