window.products.push({"id":309205,"name":"12 Set Christmas Stocking Name Tags Including Chalkboard Tags Wood Beads and Bow, DIY Name Sign Christmas Ornaments for Christmas Stockings Home Farmh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yykLhJMmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You will receive: 12 sets of Christmas socks name tags, including 12 pieces of wooden chalkboard tags, 12 pieces of burlap mini bows, 36 pieces of wooden beads; You can make Christmas socks name tag decorations or Christmas tree ornaments DIY name tags: these blackboard tags are blank, and words and small icons can be added on them through chalk or vinyl; Then assemble together the matching rope, wooden beads and bows to become a delicate farmhouse ornament Detailed size information: the size of the blackboard is 4.5 x 2.6 inches, and the diameter of the wooden beads is 16 mm/ 0.63 inches, and it is equipped with hemp rope of the appropriate length; You can also adjust its length according to your actual needs Christmas decorations: personalized present tags can well match the Christmas theme, which will bring exquisite festive decorations to your home, and the classic design can also create a happy and warm Christmas atmosphere for your festival Widely applied: you can hang our hanging chalkboard labels on Christmas socks and mark them to distinguish the ownership of gifts; You can also decorate parties and rooms with wooden cards; There are no words on the wooden cards, so you can give full play to your imagination to design them and create your personalized masterpieces","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yykLhJMmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Junkin","source_asin":"B0C1Z599Q1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-309205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1Z599Q1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1Z599Q1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":309206,"name":"Classic Brands Cranleigh Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support, King, Linen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vg4GM7MaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Take your master suite from drab to delightful in seconds with this classically styled upholstered platform bed frame. The Cranleigh Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support can be used with any mattress size or type; no box-spring required. The Cranleigh is constructed with metal tubing that is not only strong but lightweight and long-lasting and includes a sturdy and durable wood slat and center support system. Designed with exceptional quality, the Cranleigh headboard boasts deep inset tufted-buttons with diamond stitching upholstery and is super soft to the touch. The low-profile bed frame is supported by 8-inch solid wood legs and the headboard is a little over 4-feet tall. Available in both grey and linen. Combine our DeCoro Cranleigh Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support with your memory foam, latex, or innerspring mattress to add unparalleled support. It will extend the longevity of your mattress by properly supporting your mattress, and ultimately preventing it from sagging. The slats are specifically designed to be spaced evenly across the top of the platform to form a solid base for your mattress, insuring even weight distribution throughout. The sturdy center support system is a must have for today’s heavier mattresses and is not typically found in other platform beds and is what really differentiates our bed frame from others. Benefits of the DeCoro Cranleigh Upholstered Platform Bed DeCoro Cranleigh Upholstered Platform Bed is a decorative way to give your mattress some extra support. The headboard, foundation, and frame are an all in one solution and is an excellent choice as a fashionable alternative to a traditional box spring and frame. You’ll love the way this headboard makes a beautiful statement in your bedroom. Features of the DeCoro Cranleigh Upholstered Platform Bed With classic styling, the DeCoro Cranleigh Upholstered Platform Bed is perfect for trendy and modern bedrooms as well as traditional bedrooms. Not only is the platform bed well-built and durable, it’s beautiful inset soft button-tufted diamond stitching headboard is accentuated with an edgy antique metal nail head trim. The headboard reaches a height of a little over 4 feet high which instantly makes it the centerpiece of anyone’s bedroom. The upholstered fabric is soft to the touch and the platform bed is available in either grey or linen and is now available in full, queen, or king sizes. Easy Assembly The DeCoro Upholstered Headboard Platform Bed is easy to assemble; it can be put together in less than an hour. All parts, tools, and instructions are neatly packed in a zippered compartment in the back of the headboard. Just unpack, assemble the frame and attach the hardware and you are ready to place your mattress (and foundation if you please) on top. It is recommended that the upholstered bed frame should be assembled in the room that it is intended for use: •Step 1- Take all components out of the box and position them on the floor •Step 2- Attach the legs to the bottom of the headboard and to the bottom of the footboard •Step 3- Assemble the left side rails to the center horizontal support rail. Assemble the right-side rails to the center horizontal support rail.  •Step 4- Attach the headboard to the assembled side rails •Step 5- Attach the footboard to the assembled side rails •Step 6- Attach the center support rails to the middle of assembled bed •Step 7- Attach the horizontal center support rail to the middle of the assembled bed •Step 8- Attach the wood slats •Step 7- Place your mattress on top and enjoy! Get it Right the First Time It is also a good idea to check the size and the height of your mattress to make sure you are ordering the correct size. Keep in mind that you should combine the height of the frame, foundation (if you are adding one), and the mattress to get a gauge of the how tall your bed will be. Also note, because of the solid construction of this platform bed, it is recommended that two people lift and assemble the bed. Total weight should not exceed 700 lbs. including the mattress. • Full Size - 60\" W x 84\" L x 51\" H x 102 lbs • Queen Size - 66\" W x 88\" L x 51\" H x 109 lbs • King Size - 82\" W x 88\" L x 40\" H x 132 lbs Quality Assurance DeCoro Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support is backed with a 3-year worry-free warranty. DeCoro carries a wide variety of upholstered platform bed frames in an assortment of designs to match your unique taste and style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vg4GM7MaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Brands","source_asin":"B077P1WG2R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-309206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077P1WG2R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077P1WG2R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
