window.products.push({"id":309324,"name":"Tribesigns Console Table for Entryway, 70.86 Inch Sofa Table for Living Room with 4 Tier Storage Shelves, Industrial Long Entryway Table TV Stand with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x7VMaFq+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rustic & Vintage Design: Crafted with particle board and black metal frame, this console table not only gives an attractive vintage look but also features superior durability and stability. Perfectly blend in any home decoration but without sacrificing its function, can be used as a plant table, buffet cabinet or entryway furniture for your living room, couch or hallway Durable and Stable: The quality particleboard and sturdy iron structure come together to make this work of art. Maximal weight capacity from top to bottom: 66 lbs/ 33 lbs/ 22lbs/ 66lbs. Size: 70.86\" L x 13.77\" W x 35.43\" H, large enough for you to organize coffee cup, book, potted plants or any decorations Easy to Assemble: Assembly is a breeze and all tools and instructions needed are included, refer to clear and easy understanding instruction, it takes less than 60 minutes to put the console table together. We also provide 18 months quality assurance and friendly after sales service for all our products. If you have any problem with our product, please feel free to contact us, we'll try our best to solve it as soon as possible 4-Tier Large Storage Space: Industrial Long Entryway Table offers more storage space without occupying much space for various display options. It beneath the wooden shelf offer extra space for your books, plants, shoes, bags, or boxes to keep your essentials. The sofa entry table makes all daily essentials at your easiest reach Sturdy Construction: The sofa table constructed with premium steel and water-resistant MDF board. With extra 4 non-slip adjustable feet on the bottom of legs to keep the balance and protect your floor from scratches, worry-free about toppling or wobbling","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x7VMaFq+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribesigns","source_asin":"B09MVN62K4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-309324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MVN62K4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MVN62K4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
