window.products.push({"id":309464,"name":"Kingfun Tbfit Memory Foam Folding Mattress, 4 Inch Gel-Infused Foldable Floor Mattress, Breathable Tri-fold Mattress Topper with Bamboo Cover, Soft Fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CbXokNzXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAVE MORE SPACE: The folding design saves more space in your home. It can be folded into a compact size and put into the included travel bag for space-saving, you will never have to worry about running out of space again! Compare with other bed foldable mattresses that sell travel bags separately, our folding mattress comes with a high quality travel bag! COMFORT AND SUPPORTIVE FOAM: The fold up bed mattress features a 2-Layer design that includes gel-infused memory foam and high-density support foam. The combination creates a medium-firm that balances the comfort and support and keeps its shape even after long-term use. UPGRADED BREATHABLE COVER: The memory foam floor mattress is 4''thick, soft, breathable, and quick to fold. We use a double breathable design that combines bamboo fiber fabric and meshes fabric. The non-slip cloth at the bottom of the camping foldable mattress can keep you from moving during use, and the high-quality zipper on the back is smooth and durable. MULTIFUNCTIONAL FOLDABLE MATTRESS: Are you still worrying about your friends staying overnight in your home but not having a suitable place to sleep? Kingfun portable bed is the ideal solution for temporary sleeping accommodation. It is convenient for you to move these folding beds anywhere with the handle design. Whether it is for guests staying, camping, traveling, yoga, and pilates, Kingfun foldable guest bed is your ideal choice. PACKAGE CONTENTS AND SERVICES: With the purchase of the KINGFUN portable mattress, you will not only receive a roll up mattress but also a travel bag for storage and carry. If you have any questions about our products, please feel free to contact us, we will find the best solution for every customer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CbXokNzXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kingfun","source_asin":"B09TK83GZF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-309464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TK83GZF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TK83GZF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":309465,"name":"Renaissance 600-Thread-Count Cotton Sateen King Sheet Set, Chocolate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yquLuNrjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luxurious in feel and fashionable in color, these Renaissance sheets create a premium-quality bed without breaking the bank. Sewn from fine-woven 100 percent cotton, the sheets feature a lovely sateen weave, with most threads placed on the surface to create a glossy, lustrous shine. The hand feel is silky smooth yet the sheets are durable, and the thread-count of 600 is comparable to bedding in a high-end hotel. The set includes one fitted sheet, one flat sheet, and two pillowcases. The fitted sheet is fully elasticized for a secure fit, and its 16-inch pockets fit mattresses up to 18 inches deep. Both the flat sheet and the cases come with a 4-inch hem and marrow stitching for a fully finished look. The set is available in a range of sizes, and it washes up in the machine and tumbles dry for easy care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yquLuNrjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Renaissance","source_asin":"B000JWWFMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-309465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000JWWFMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000JWWFMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
