window.products.push({"id":309469,"name":"Overstock CozyBlock Scandinavian Orange Molded Plastic Dining Arm Chair with Black Wood Eiffel Legs (Set of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516nztTZtvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"CozyBlock DAW Scandinavian Molded Plastic Dining Arm Chair with Black walnut Wood Eiffel Legs - Mid-Century Modern Accent Armchair - Ideal for Home, Bar, Cafe, Office, Reception, Waiting Area. Some designs were ahead of their time. Considered the chair of tomorrow both for its design and its innovative single-mold manufacturing process, the DAW Scandinavian Arm Chair is inspired by one of the most iconic mid-century furniture designs. Created in the spirit of economy and affordability, its unique shape was designed to spread the sitter's weight and pressure evenly. The deep seat and waterfall edge provide additional comfort as the design shapes itself around the body's curves, while its Black walnut wood Eiffel legs add a classic touch. If you have done away with formality in your home, the DAW Scandinavian Arm Chair is that one piece of furniture that exemplifies the \"less is more\" ethos. It's the ultimate seat that goes well in a variety of residential and commercial settings: as a home office chair, a statement reading chair, an entryway slipper seat, a cafe chair, a reception area chair, set a few as office brainstorming chairs, or anywhere a decent seat is needed. Product Dimensions- Overall: 32\" H x 24.6\" W x 24.25\" L. Seat: 17.5\" H x 17.5\" W x 17\" L. Arm: 26\" H x 24.6\" W. Weight Capacity: 250 lbs. Please take precise measurements of your table before placing an order. Package Included-Chair Seat, Chair Base (base is fully assembled), Installation Hardware and Instruction.Comfortable and versatile, the DAW Scandinavian series arm chair can be used to decorate virtually any spaces. Its clean, simple, organic shapes are sculpted to fit the body. With solid wood legs backed by steel reinforcement, this classy chair has tip-resistant stabilitySporting a clean, simple, retro, yet modern design sculpted to fit the body, this gorgeous arm chair is the perfect addition to your home or workspace. Available in multiple colors.The legs are made from solid woo","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516nztTZtvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Overstock","source_asin":"B07SXRLMZ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-309469","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SXRLMZ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SXRLMZ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
